      "attestations": [
        {
          "text": "WANG Ming-shêng 王鳴盛 (T. 鳳階, 禮堂, H. 西莊, 西沚), 1722–1798, Jan. 18, scholar, was a native of Chia-ting, Kiangsu. His grandfather, Wang Hun 王焜 (T. 大生, H. 卓人), was a chü-jên of 1696; and his father, Wang Êr-ta 王爾達 (T. 通侯, H. 虛亭, 1693–1768), was a scholar and teacher.",
          "source": "eccp-3672749",
